    kind: invariant  # 95d2
    title: "noise filter drops kind=section and kind=paragraph in EVERY language: COBOL paragraphs/sections (callables with PERFORM/CALL edges) and their call edges vanish from the default view (WI-tisom residual)"  # 95d2
    status: violated  # 95d2
    priority: 2  # 95d2
    parent:  # 95d2
    tags:  # 95d2
