  nonce: 12cd  # 12cd
  message: "Re-observed 2026-10-13 on dev 4c213ee87c (WI-tusad B7): hypergumbo run on a 2-program COBOL file (bank.cob, 6 paragraphs, 2 sections, 8 data items) emits 0 paragraph/section nodes in the default view (2 program + 8 data + file); with --include-docs all 8 appear with producer stable_ids. The analyzer emits them (analyze_cobol: 4 paragraph + 2 section symbols); noise_filter._NOISE_SYMBOL_KINDS drops them. B7 gave them producer ids (program/section chain) so they are ready once the filter stops dropping them."  # 12cd
